      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、それは戦争を終えてからだ。\r\n負傷兵たちを頼む。",
        "official_en": "Though it will have to be after all this is over. Please, go and save our injured soldiers.",
        "real_en": "But that can wait until the war is over. Please take care of the wounded soldiers."
