        "official_en_sha256": "5b7660ec9857a01058863c80f6e918e1253091075abcf8497191ec7f03c7dc7e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レイン。\r\nお前とは一度、ゆっくり話をしてみたいな。",
        "official_en": "Rain. Let us find the time to talk again soon.",
        "real_en": "Rain, I'd like to sit down and have a proper talk with you someday."
      },
