    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C05_523_01:523_01_007:26a71f55",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C05_523_01",
        "key": "523_01_007",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C05_523_01:523_01_007:26a71f55",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C05_523_01:523_01_007:26a71f55",
        "jp_sha256": "e6ac816eb1093b90297d7608a9a74479e9aec2e4ff406fb163fa3ab83148f9d2",
        "official_en_sha256": "5a918f1a73df3e9ef7ad68a40ff88622ae09f85ada02d5f65f25594c24e97432"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "一体、どれだけの犠牲を出せば\r\nこの戦争は終わるのか……。",
        "official_en": "...just how much sacrifice must be made before all this ends.",
        "real_en": "How many more lives will this war claim before it ends...?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
