        "official_en_sha256": "73fcd46e7d0e50bee2189a98f0496c4fb326e0769fabb6a926129bcab8e28d6a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "矛盾しているみたいだけど、\r\n俺が剣を振るうのも\r\n世界から争いをなくしたいからだし。",
        "official_en": "I know it sounds contradictory that I fight to <text style=\"italic\">end</> fights, but that’s what I strive for.",
        "real_en": "It may sound contradictory, but the reason I swing my sword is that I want to put an end to conflict in this world."
      },
