        "official_en_sha256": "7be1d6b49461391a6dc6bb40690854ec48a992db26716f49b25d63c117ea3fac"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "私は最後まで話し合いでの解決を望んでいた。\r\nこの世界から戦争をなくすことはできる。\r\nそれこそが人間の英知だと思うからだ。",
        "official_en": "...I wanted to resolve all of this through dialogue. If we choose words instead of weapons, we <text style=\"italic\">can</> eradicate war from this world... What a testament to human wisdom that would be.",
        "real_en": "I wanted to resolve this through dialogue right to the very end. I believe humanity has the wisdom to rid this world of war."
      },
